Batch Patient Import Spreadsheet

Instructions:
- One row per patient.
- Keep the header row unchanged.
- Use the same column names as the Clinical Intake Wizard.
- Leave consentTemplateId blank if the batch wizard will inject it globally.

Columns:
patientName,birthDate,email,phone,cpf,isDeceased,representativeName,representativeEmail,representativeCpf,representativePhone,sampleType,sampleOrigin,extractionProtocol,quantity,quality,linkedProject,collectionInstitution,collectionInstitutionAcronym,consentTemplateId

Example:
John Doe,10/05/1980,john.doe@example.com,+55 11 91234-5678,12345678901,false,,,,,PLASMA,VENOUS_BLOOD,TUBE_EDTA,500,GOOD,Genomics Project,Central Lab,CL,
